  /* â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•
     CONTAINER
     â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â• */
  .ses {
    max-width: 96rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding-bottom: 8rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.6rem;
  }

  /* â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•
     ACTION BAR â€” Annuler / Enregistrer
     Sticky to the viewport bottom so the primary action is
     always reachable, even with many exercises added.
     â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â• */
  .ses__actions {
    position: sticky;
    bottom: 0;
    z-index: 20;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    gap: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    padding: 1.2rem 1.6rem;
      background-color: var(--color-surface);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  /* â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•
     BUTTONS (reusable variants)
     â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â• */
  .ses__btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    height: 4.4rem;
    padding: 0 1.8rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    border: 1px solid transparent;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    cursor: pointer;
    min-width: 8rem;
    transition: background-color var(--transition-fast),
                border-color var(--transition-fast),
                color var(--transition-fast),
                box-shadow var(--transition-fast),
                transform var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .ses__btn:active {
    transform: scale(0.97);
  }

  .ses__btn:focus-visible {
    outline: none;
    box-shadow: var(--focus-ring);
  }

  .ses__btn--sm {
    height: 4.4rem;
    padding: 0 1.4rem;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
  }

  .ses__btn--primary {
    background-color: var(--color-accent);
    color: var(--color-accent-foreground);
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent) 25%, transparent);
  }

  .ses__btn--primary:hover:not(:disabled):not(.is-disabled) {
    background-color: var(--color-accent-hover);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 14px color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent) 40%, transparent);
  }

  .ses__btn--primary:disabled,
  .ses__btn--primary.is-disabled {
    opacity: 0.45;
    cursor: not-allowed;
    box-shadow: none;
    background-color: var(--color-surface-3);
    border-color: var(--color-border);
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }

  .ses__btn--secondary {
    background-color: transparent;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    border-color: var(--color-border);
  }

  .ses__btn--secondary:hover {
    background-color: var(--alpha-bg-soft);
    border-color: var(--alpha-border);
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .ses__btn-icon {
    width: 1.5rem;
    height: 1.5rem;
  }

  /* â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•
     SESSION INFO â€” form grid
     â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â• */
  .ses__info-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 1.6rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .ses__info-grid {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 2fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
      align-items: end;
    }
  }

  .ses__field {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.6rem;
  }

  .ses__label {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .ses__req {
    color: var(--color-destructive);
    margin-left: 0.2rem;
  }

  .ses__input,
  .ses__select {
    width: 100%;
    height: 4.4rem;
    padding: 0 1.4rem;
    background-color: var(--color-surface-2);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
    outline: none;
    transition: border-color var(--transition-fast), box-shadow var(--transition-fast);
    -webkit-appearance: none;
    appearance: none;
  }

  .ses__input::placeholder {
    color: var(--alpha-text-faint);
  }

  .ses__input:focus,
  .ses__select:focus {
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
    box-shadow: var(--focus-ring);
  }

  /* Inline inputs inside the sets table */
  .ses__input--inline {
    height: 3.4rem;
    padding: 0 0.6rem;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    text-align: center;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }

  .ses__input--inline::-webkit-outer-spin-button,
  .ses__input--inline::-webkit-inner-spin-button {
    -webkit-appearance: none;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ses__input--inline {
    -moz-appearance: textfield;
  }

  .ses__select--inline {
    height: 3.4rem;
    padding: 0 2.2rem 0 0.8rem;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(45deg, transparent 50%, var(--color-muted) 50%),
      linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-muted) 50%, transparent 50%);
    background-position:
      calc(100% - 1.3rem) 50%,
      calc(100% - 0.8rem) 50%;
    background-size: 0.5rem 0.5rem, 0.5rem 0.5rem;
    background-repeat: no-repeat;
  }

  /* Native date picker indicator on dark theme */
  .ses__input[type='date'] {
    color-scheme: dark;
  }

  /* â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•
     EXERCISE BLOCK â€” header + table
     â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â• */

  /* â”€â”€ Collapsible header (always visible) â”€â”€ */
  .ses__ex-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--spacing-2);
    padding-bottom: var(--spacing-3);
  }

  .ses__ex-toggle {
    flex: 1 1 auto;
    min-width: 0;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: var(--spacing-3);
    padding: var(--spacing-2) var(--spacing-3);
    margin: calc(var(--spacing-2) * -1) calc(var(--spacing-3) * -1);
    background-color: transparent;
    border: 1px solid transparent;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    color: inherit;
    font: inherit;
    text-align: left;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background-color var(--transition-fast),
                border-color var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .ses__ex-toggle:hover {
    background-color: var(--alpha-bg-subtle);
    border-color: var(--alpha-bg-soft);
  }

  .ses__ex-toggle:focus-visible {
    outline: none;
    background-color: var(--alpha-bg-subtle);
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
    box-shadow: var(--focus-ring);
  }

  .ses__ex-toggle-main {
    flex: 1 1 auto;
    min-width: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.4rem;
  }

  .ses__ex-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .ses__ex-name {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-text);
    line-height: 1.2;
    word-break: break-word;
  }

  .ses__ex-summary {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.3;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
  }

  .ses__ex-chevron {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 1.8rem;
    height: 1.8rem;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    transition: transform var(--transition-fast),
                color var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .ses__ex-chevron.is-open {
    transform: rotate(180deg);
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  /* â”€â”€ Collapsible body (the sets table + actions) â”€â”€ */
  .ses__ex-body {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    padding-top: var(--spacing-3);
  }

  /* â”€â”€ Sets table â”€â”€ */
  .ses__table {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    overflow: hidden;
    background-color: var(--color-surface-2);
  }

  .ses__table-head,
  .ses__table-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 3.2rem minmax(0, 1.3fr) minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 0.8fr) minmax(0, 1fr) 9.6rem;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    padding: 0 1.0rem;
  }

  .ses__table-head {
    height: 3.2rem;
    background-color: var(--color-surface-3);
    font-size: 1.0rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }

  .ses__table-row {
    min-height: 4.0rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    transition: background-color var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .ses__table-row:hover {
    background-color: var(--alpha-bg-subtle);
  }

  .ses__cell {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .ses__cell--num {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }

  .ses__table-head .ses__cell--num {
    font-size: 1.0rem;
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }

  .ses__cell--type {
    justify-content: stretch;
  }

  /* â”€â”€ Per-set RPE control (added 2026-08-09) â”€â”€
     Compact segmented RPE/uRPE toggle + 0.5-step value select,
     shown once the set is marked complete. Stays inline so rows
     keep their 6-column grid on desktop. */
  .ses__rpe-set {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .ses__rpe-toggle {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    gap: 0.2rem;
    padding: 0.2rem;
    background-color: var(--color-surface-3);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
  }

  .ses__rpe-toggle-btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    min-height: 4.4rem;
    padding: 0 0.8rem;
    background-color: transparent;
    border: none;
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1;
    cursor: pointer;
    -webkit-appearance: none;
    appearance: none;
    transition: background-color var(--transition-fast),
                color var(--transition-fast),
                box-shadow var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .ses__rpe-toggle-btn.is-active {
    background-color: var(--color-surface);
    color: var(--color-text);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-1);
  }

  .ses__rpe-toggle-btn:focus-visible {
    outline: none;
    box-shadow: var(--focus-ring);
  }

  .ses__rpe-select {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 6.4rem;
    padding: 0 2.0rem 0 0.6rem;
  }

  .ses__cell--action {
    justify-content: flex-end;
    gap: 0.4rem;
  }

  /* â”€â”€ Exercise block footer actions â”€â”€ */
  .ses__ex-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: flex-start;
    gap: 0.8rem;
    padding-top: 1.0rem;
  }

  /* â”€â”€ Warmup auto-generation button (dashed accent) â”€â”€ */
  .ses__btn--warmup {
    background-color: transparent;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
    border-style: dashed;
  }

  .ses__btn--warmup:hover:not(:disabled):not(.is-disabled) {
    background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent) 10%, transparent);
    border-style: solid;
  }

  .ses__btn--warmup:disabled,
  .ses__btn--warmup.is-disabled {
    opacity: 0.40;
    cursor: not-allowed;
    background-color: transparent;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    border-color: var(--color-border);
    border-style: dashed;
    box-shadow: none;
  }

  /* â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•
     ICON BUTTONS (remove exercise / remove set)
     â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â• */
  .ses__icon-btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 4.4rem;
    height: 4.4rem;
    background-color: transparent;
    border: 1px solid transparent;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    color: var(--color-muted);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background-color var(--transition-fast),
                border-color var(--transition-fast),
                color var(--transition-fast),
                transform var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .ses__icon-btn:hover {
    background-color: var(--alpha-bg-soft);
    border-color: var(--alpha-border-faint);
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .ses__icon-btn:active {
    transform: scale(0.94);
  }

  .ses__icon-btn:focus-visible {
    outline: none;
    box-shadow: var(--focus-ring);
    border-color: var(--alpha-border);
  }

  .ses__icon-btn--sm {
    width: 4.4rem;
    height: 4.4rem;
  }

  .ses__icon-btn--danger:hover {
    background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-destructive) 12%, transparent);
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-destructive) 40%, transparent);
    color: var(--color-destructive);
  }

  .ses__icon {
    width: 1.6rem;
    height: 1.6rem;
  }

  .ses__icon-btn--sm .ses__icon {
    width: 1.6rem;
    height: 1.6rem;
  }

  /* â”€â”€ Set completion toggle (added 2026-08-04) â”€â”€
     Inline check button on the right side of each set row. Outlined
     when incomplete, filled accent when complete. Clicking it also
     starts the per-exercise rest timer. */
  .ses__set-complete {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 4.4rem;
    height: 4.4rem;
    background-color: transparent;
    border: 1.5px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 50%;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    cursor: pointer;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    transition: background-color var(--transition-fast),
                border-color var(--transition-fast),
                color var(--transition-fast),
                transform var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .ses__set-complete:hover {
    background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-success) 10%, transparent);
    border-color: var(--color-success);
    color: var(--color-success);
  }

  .ses__set-complete:active {
    transform: scale(0.92);
  }

  .ses__set-complete.is-complete {
    background-color: var(--color-success);
    border-color: var(--color-success);
    color: var(--color-bg);
  }

  .ses__set-complete.is-complete:hover {
    background-color: var(--color-success);
    border-color: var(--color-success);
  }

  .ses__set-complete:focus-visible {
    outline: none;
    box-shadow: var(--focus-ring);
  }

  .ses__set-complete svg {
    width: 1.6rem;
    height: 1.6rem;
  }

  /* â”€â”€ MRV â€” suggested-load button in the weight cell (added 2026-08-10) â”€â”€
     Small bolt next to the weight input. Disabled (dimmed) when the
     exercise has no exploitable history; the title localises the reason. */
  .ses__weight-cell {
    display: flex;
    align-items: stretch;
    width: 100%;
    gap: 0.3rem;
  }

  .ses__weight-cell .ses__input--inline {
    flex: 1 1 auto;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .ses__mrv-btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 4.0rem;
    height: 4.0rem;
    padding: 0;
    background-color: transparent;
    border: 1px solid transparent;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    color: var(--color-muted);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background-color var(--transition-fast),
                border-color var(--transition-fast),
                color var(--transition-fast),
                opacity var(--transition-fast),
                transform var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .ses__mrv-btn:hover:not(.is-disabled):not(:disabled) {
    background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent) 12%, transparent);
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .ses__mrv-btn:active:not(:disabled) {
    transform: scale(0.94);
  }

  .ses__mrv-btn:focus-visible {
    outline: none;
    box-shadow: var(--focus-ring);
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .ses__mrv-btn:disabled {
    opacity: 0.35;
    cursor: not-allowed;
  }

  /* â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•
     ADD EXERCISE â€” empty state + bottom row
     â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â• */
  .ses__add-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 0.4rem 0;
  }

  .ses__add-btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.8rem;
    height: 4.4rem;
    padding: 0 2rem;
    background-color: var(--color-surface);
    color: var(--color-text);
    border: 1px dashed var(--alpha-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background-color var(--transition-fast),
                border-color var(--transition-fast),
                color var(--transition-fast),
                transform var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .ses__add-btn:hover {
    background-color: var(--color-surface-2);
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
    border-style: solid;
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .ses__add-btn:active {
    transform: scale(0.98);
  }

  .ses__add-btn:focus-visible {
    outline: none;
    box-shadow: var(--focus-ring);
  }

  .ses__add-btn--primary {
    border-style: solid;
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
    background-color: var(--color-accent);
    color: var(--color-accent-foreground);
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent) 25%, transparent);
  }

  .ses__add-btn--primary:hover {
    background-color: var(--color-accent-hover);
    border-color: var(--color-accent-hover);
    color: var(--color-accent-foreground);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 14px color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent) 40%, transparent);
  }

  .ses__add-icon {
    width: 1.6rem;
    height: 1.6rem;
  }

  /* â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•
     EMPTY STATE
     â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â• */
  .ses__empty {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 3.6rem 1.6rem 3rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .ses__empty-icon {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 5.6rem;
    height: 5.6rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent) 10%, transparent);
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .ses__empty-icon svg {
    width: 2.8rem;
    height: 2.8rem;
  }

  .ses__empty-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.7rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-top: 1.4rem;
  }

  .ses__empty-desc {
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    max-width: 38rem;
    margin: 0.6rem 0 0;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  /* â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•
     VALIDATION HINT
     â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â• */
  .ses__hint {
    background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-destructive) 8%, transparent);
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-destructive) 25%, transparent);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    color: var(--color-destructive);
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    padding: 1rem 1.4rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  /* â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•
     EXERCISE PICKER (inside Dialog)
     â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â• */
  .ses__picker {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.2rem;
    margin-top: 0.4rem;
  }

  .ses__search {
    position: relative;
  }

  .ses__search-icon {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 1.4rem;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
    width: 1.6rem;
    height: 1.6rem;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  /* Search field renders via the Input primitive (child component), so
     the scoped override must target it with :global() â€” same convention
     as the sÃ©ances list (index.astro). */
  .ses__search :global(.ses__search-input) {
    width: 100%;
    height: 4.4rem;
    padding: 0 1.4rem 0 4.2rem;
    background-color: var(--color-surface-2);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    outline: none;
    transition: border-color var(--transition-fast), box-shadow var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .ses__search :global(.ses__search-input)::placeholder {
    color: var(--alpha-text-faint);
  }

  .ses__search :global(.ses__search-input)::-webkit-search-cancel-button {
    -webkit-appearance: none;
    appearance: none;
  }

  .ses__search :global(.ses__search-input):focus {
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
    box-shadow: var(--focus-ring);
  }

  .ses__picker-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    max-height: 36rem;
    overflow-y: auto;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    background-color: var(--color-surface-2);
  }

  .ses__picker-item {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem 1rem;
    width: 100%;
    padding: 1.0rem 1.6rem;
    background-color: transparent;
    border: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    color: var(--color-text);
    text-align: left;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    transition: background-color var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .ses__picker-item:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .ses__picker-item:hover {
    background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent) 8%, transparent);
  }

  .ses__picker-item-main {
    grid-column: 1;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    width: 100%;
    min-width: 0;
    background: transparent;
    border: none;
    color: inherit;
    text-align: left;
    cursor: pointer;
    font: inherit;
    padding: 0.2rem 0;
  }

  .ses__picker-tip-toggle {
    grid-column: 2;
    grid-row: 1 / 3;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 4.4rem;
    height: 4.4rem;
    background-color: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    color: var(--color-muted);
    cursor: pointer;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    transition: background-color var(--transition-fast),
                border-color var(--transition-fast),
                color var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .ses__picker-tip-toggle:hover {
    background-color: var(--color-surface-3);
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .ses__picker-tip-toggle svg {
    width: 1.6rem;
    height: 1.6rem;
  }

  .ses__picker-tip {
    grid-column: 1;
    grid-row: 2;
    margin: 0;

    min-width: 0;
    padding: 0.9rem 1.0rem;
    background-color: var(--color-surface-2);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  /* Tip callout: no side-stripe (refonte Â§2 rule 4) â€” the leading accent
     disc carries the highlight, same signal as the superset dot. */
  .ses__picker-tip::before {
    content: "";
    display: inline-block;
    width: 0.9rem;
    height: 0.9rem;
    margin-right: 0.7rem;
    vertical-align: middle;
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    background-color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  /* â”€â”€ YouTube technique link (added 2026-08-04) â”€â”€ */
  .ses__tip-video {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-top: 0.8rem;
    padding: 0.5rem 0.9rem;
    background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-destructive) 10%, transparent);
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-destructive) 32%, transparent);
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    color: var(--color-destructive);
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-decoration: none;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    transition: background-color var(--transition-fast),
                border-color var(--transition-fast),
                color var(--transition-fast),
                transform var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .ses__tip-video:hover {
    background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-destructive) 18%, transparent);
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-destructive) 50%, transparent);
    color: var(--color-destructive);
  }

  .ses__tip-video:active {
    transform: scale(0.97);
  }

  .ses__tip-video svg {
    width: 1.3rem;
    height: 1.3rem;
    fill: currentColor;
    stroke: currentColor;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .ses__tip-video svg polygon {
    fill: currentColor;
    stroke: none;
  }

  .ses__picker-name {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.2;
    min-width: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .ses__picker-empty {
    padding: 2.6rem 1.6rem;
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }

  .ses__picker-empty p {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .ses__picker-link {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
  }

  /* â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•
     TEMPLATES (added 2026-08-04)
     â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â• */
  .ses__templates {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.8rem;
    padding-bottom: 1.2rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
  }

  .ses__templates-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .ses__templates-eyebrow {
    font-size: 1.0rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .ses__templates-hint {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }

  .ses__templates-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 0.6rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .ses__templates-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  .ses__template {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    width: 100%;
    padding: 1.0rem 1.2rem;
    background-color: var(--color-surface);
    color: var(--color-text);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    text-align: left;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    transition: background-color var(--transition-fast),
                border-color var(--transition-fast),
                transform var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .ses__template:hover {
    background-color: var(--color-surface-2);
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .ses__template:active {
    transform: scale(0.98);
  }

  .ses__template:focus-visible {
    outline: none;
    box-shadow: var(--focus-ring);
  }

  .ses__template-name {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .ses__template-desc {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .ses__template-count {
    font-size: 1.0rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.10em;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  /* â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•
     SUPERSET UI (added 2026-08-04)
     â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â• */
  .ses__ex-superset-bar {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    padding: 0.6rem 1.2rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
    background-color: var(--alpha-bg-soft);
    color: var(--color-text);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  /* Group colour comes from the tokenized superset palette
     (--color-superset-gN, src/styles/tokens.css): the bar gets the
     10% wash and the inline dot carries the full hue. No side-stripes
     (refonte Â§2 rule 4). */
  .ses__ex-superset-bar--g1 {
    --ses-super-color: var(--color-superset-g1);
    background-color: var(--color-superset-g1-bg);
  }
  .ses__ex-superset-bar--g2 {
    --ses-super-color: var(--color-superset-g2);
    background-color: var(--color-superset-g2-bg);
  }
  .ses__ex-superset-bar--g3 {
    --ses-super-color: var(--color-superset-g3);
    background-color: var(--color-superset-g3-bg);
  }
  .ses__ex-superset-bar--g4 {
    --ses-super-color: var(--color-superset-g4);
    background-color: var(--color-superset-g4-bg);
  }
  .ses__ex-superset-bar--g5 {
    --ses-super-color: var(--color-superset-g5);
    background-color: var(--color-superset-g5-bg);
  }

  .ses__ex-superset-dot {
    width: 0.9rem;
    height: 0.9rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    background-color: var(--ses-super-color, var(--color-muted));
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .ses__ex-superset-icon {
    width: 1.4rem;
    height: 1.4rem;
    color: currentColor;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .ses__ex-superset-remove {
    margin-left: auto;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 4.4rem;
    height: 4.4rem;
    background: transparent;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    color: var(--color-muted);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background-color var(--transition-fast),
                border-color var(--transition-fast),
                color var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .ses__ex-superset-remove:focus-visible {
    outline: none;
    box-shadow: var(--focus-ring);
  }

  .ses__ex-superset-remove:hover {
    background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-destructive) 10%, transparent);
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-destructive) 35%, transparent);
    color: var(--color-destructive);
  }

  .ses__ex-superset-remove svg {
    width: 1.5rem;
    height: 1.5rem;
  }

  .ses__ex-superset-select {
    height: 4.0rem;
    padding: 0 2.2rem 0 1.0rem;
    background-color: var(--color-surface-2);
    color: var(--color-text);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    cursor: pointer;
    -webkit-appearance: none;
    appearance: none;
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(45deg, transparent 50%, var(--color-muted) 50%),
      linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-muted) 50%, transparent 50%);
    background-position:
      calc(100% - 1.3rem) 50%,
      calc(100% - 0.8rem) 50%;
    background-size: 0.5rem 0.5rem, 0.5rem 0.5rem;
    background-repeat: no-repeat;
    transition: border-color var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .ses__ex-superset-select:focus-visible {
    outline: none;
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
    box-shadow: var(--focus-ring);
  }

  /* â”€â”€ Superset bar label + member chain (added 2026-08-09) â”€â”€ */
  .ses__ex-superset-label {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    min-width: 0;
    flex: 1 1 auto;
  }

  .ses__ex-superset-chain {
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    text-transform: none;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  /* â”€â”€ Auto-superset offer bar (added 2026-08-09) â”€â”€ */
  .ses__ex-offer {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.8rem;
    padding: 0.8rem 1.2rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
    background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent) 8%, transparent);
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent) 28%, transparent);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    /* No side-stripe (refonte Â§2 rule 4): wash background + leading
       accent icon already carry the status signal. */
  }

  .ses__ex-offer-icon {
    width: 1.5rem;
    height: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .ses__ex-offer-body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.1rem;
    min-width: 0;
    flex: 1 1 auto;
  }

  .ses__ex-offer-title {
    font-size: 1.0rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .ses__ex-offer-names {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-text);
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .ses__ex-offer-actions {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .ses__ex-offer-btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    height: 4.4rem;
    padding: 0 1.2rem;
    background-color: var(--color-accent);
    color: var(--color-accent-foreground);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-accent);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background-color var(--transition-fast),
                transform var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .ses__ex-offer-btn:hover {
    background-color: var(--color-accent-hover);
  }

  .ses__ex-offer-btn:active {
    transform: scale(0.97);
  }

  .ses__ex-offer-btn:focus-visible {
    outline: none;
    box-shadow: var(--focus-ring);
  }

  .ses__ex-offer-btn svg {
    width: 1.3rem;
    height: 1.3rem;
  }

  .ses__ex-offer-dismiss {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 4.4rem;
    height: 4.4rem;
    background-color: transparent;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    color: var(--color-muted);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background-color var(--transition-fast),
                color var(--transition-fast),
                border-color var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .ses__ex-offer-dismiss svg {
    width: 1.3rem;
    height: 1.3rem;
  }

  .ses__ex-offer-dismiss:focus-visible {
    outline: none;
    box-shadow: var(--focus-ring);
  }

  .ses__ex-offer-dismiss:hover {
    background-color: var(--alpha-bg-soft);
    color: var(--color-text);
    border-color: var(--alpha-border);
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .ses__ex-offer {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: stretch;
      gap: 0.6rem;
    }
    .ses__ex-offer-actions {
      justify-content: flex-end;
    }
  }

  /* â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•
     SESSION NOTES â€” RPE / fatigue / mood / textarea
     Compact spacing (2026-08-04): the four blocks (RPE, fatigue,
     mood, free-text) used to eat ~50% of the page height. Tightened
     gaps + smaller RPE value chip + shorter textarea so the whole
     notes card fits comfortably without dominating the screen.
     â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â• */
  .ses__notes {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.4rem;
  }

  .ses__notes-field {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.6rem;
  }

  .ses__notes-label-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  /* â”€â”€ RPE slider â”€â”€ */
  .ses__rpe {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.0rem;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .ses__rpe-input {
    flex: 1 1 auto;
    -webkit-appearance: none;
    appearance: none;
    height: 0.8rem;
    background-color: var(--color-surface-3);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    outline: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: box-shadow var(--transition-fast),
                border-color var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .ses__rpe-input:focus-visible {
    box-shadow: var(--focus-ring);
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  /* WebKit thumb */
  .ses__rpe-input::-webkit-slider-thumb {
    -webkit-appearance: none;
    appearance: none;
    width: 2.4rem;
    height: 2.4rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: var(--color-success);
    border: 3px solid var(--color-surface);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-2);
    cursor: grab;
    transition: background-color var(--transition-fast),
                transform var(--transition-fast),
                box-shadow var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .ses__rpe-input:active::-webkit-slider-thumb {
    cursor: grabbing;
    transform: scale(1.08);
  }

  /* Firefox thumb */
  .ses__rpe-input::-moz-range-thumb {
    width: 2.4rem;
    height: 2.4rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: var(--color-success);
    border: 3px solid var(--color-surface);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-2);
    cursor: grab;
    transition: background-color var(--transition-fast),
                transform var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .ses__rpe-input--easy::-webkit-slider-thumb { background-color: var(--color-success); }
  .ses__rpe-input--easy::-moz-range-thumb     { background-color: var(--color-success); }
  .ses__rpe-input--moderate::-webkit-slider-thumb { background-color: var(--color-warning); }
  .ses__rpe-input--moderate::-moz-range-thumb     { background-color: var(--color-warning); }
  .ses__rpe-input--hard::-webkit-slider-thumb { background-color: var(--color-accent); }
  .ses__rpe-input--hard::-moz-range-thumb     { background-color: var(--color-accent); }
  .ses__rpe-input--max::-webkit-slider-thumb { background-color: var(--color-destructive); }
  .ses__rpe-input--max::-moz-range-thumb     { background-color: var(--color-destructive); }

  /* â”€â”€ RPE value chip + label readout â”€â”€ */
  .ses__rpe-value {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    min-width: 3.8rem;
    height: 3.8rem;
    padding: 0 0.8rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 2.0rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-success) 12%, transparent);
    color: var(--color-success);
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-success) 30%, transparent);
    transition: background-color var(--transition-fast),
                color var(--transition-fast),
                border-color var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .ses__rpe-value--easy {
    background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-success) 12%, transparent);
    color: var(--color-success);
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-success) 30%, transparent);
  }
  .ses__rpe-value--moderate {
    background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-warning) 14%, transparent);
    color: var(--color-warning);
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-warning) 32%, transparent);
  }
  .ses__rpe-value--hard {
    background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent) 14%, transparent);
    color: var(--color-accent);
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent) 34%, transparent);
  }
  .ses__rpe-value--max {
    background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-destructive) 14%, transparent);
    color: var(--color-destructive);
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-destructive) 34%, transparent);
  }

  .ses__rpe-readout {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    min-width: 7.6rem;
    text-align: right;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.10em;
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }

  /* â”€â”€ Fatigue (5 flame icons) â”€â”€ */
  .ses__fatigue {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
  }

  .ses__fatigue-btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 4.4rem;
    height: 4.4rem;
    padding: 0;
    color: var(--color-text);
    background-color: var(--color-surface-2);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    cursor: pointer;
    filter: grayscale(1) opacity(0.40);
    transition: filter var(--transition-fast),
                background-color var(--transition-fast),
                border-color var(--transition-fast),
                transform var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .ses__fatigue-btn svg {
    display: block;
  }

  .ses__fatigue-btn:hover {
    filter: grayscale(0.4) opacity(0.85);
    background-color: var(--color-surface-3);
    border-color: var(--alpha-border);
  }

  .ses__fatigue-btn:active {
    transform: scale(0.94);
  }

  .ses__fatigue-btn:focus-visible {
    outline: none;
    box-shadow: var(--focus-ring);
    border-color: var(--alpha-border);
  }

  .ses__fatigue-btn.is-active {
    filter: none;
    background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent) 12%, transparent);
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent) 40%, transparent);
  }

  /* â”€â”€ Mood (5 Lucide icons) â”€â”€ */
  .ses__mood {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .ses__mood-btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 4.4rem;
    height: 4.4rem;
    padding: 0;
    color: var(--color-text);
    background-color: var(--color-surface-2);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    cursor: pointer;
    filter: grayscale(0.6) opacity(0.55);
    transition: filter var(--transition-fast),
                background-color var(--transition-fast),
                border-color var(--transition-fast),
                transform var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .ses__mood-btn svg {
    display: block;
  }

  .ses__mood-btn:hover {
    filter: grayscale(0.2) opacity(0.95);
    background-color: var(--color-surface-3);
    border-color: var(--alpha-border);
  }

  .ses__mood-btn:active {
    transform: scale(0.94);
  }

  .ses__mood-btn:focus-visible {
    outline: none;
    box-shadow: var(--focus-ring);
    border-color: var(--alpha-border);
  }

  .ses__mood-btn.is-active {
    filter: none;
    background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent) 14%, transparent);
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent) 45%, transparent);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent) 18%, transparent);
  }

  /* â”€â”€ Textarea â”€â”€ */
  .ses__notes-textarea {
    width: 100%;
    min-height: 7.2rem;
    padding: 1.0rem 1.2rem;
    background-color: var(--color-surface-2);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    resize: vertical;
    outline: none;
    transition: border-color var(--transition-fast), box-shadow var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .ses__notes-textarea::placeholder {
    color: var(--alpha-border);
  }

  .ses__notes-textarea:focus {
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
    box-shadow: var(--focus-ring);
  }

  /* â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•
     RESPONSIVE â€” small screens
     â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â• */
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    /* Sticky bar stacks the buttons on mobile â€” give the container
       enough trailing space so the last content is never hidden. */
    .ses {
      padding-bottom: 16rem;
    }
    .ses__actions {
      flex-direction: column-reverse;
      align-items: stretch;
      padding: 1.2rem;
    }
    .ses__actions .ses__btn {
      width: 100%;
    }
    .ses__ex-header {
      gap: var(--spacing-2);
    }
    .ses__ex-toggle {
      padding: var(--spacing-2);
      margin: calc(var(--spacing-2) * -1);
    }
    .ses__ex-name {
      font-size: 1.4rem;
    }
    .ses__ex-summary {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
    }
    .ses__ex-chevron {
      width: 1.6rem;
      height: 1.6rem;
    }
    .ses__table-head {
      display: none;
    }
    .ses__table-row {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      grid-template-areas:
        'num type'
        'weight reps'
        'rpe rpe'
        'action action';
      gap: 0.6rem;
      padding: 1.0rem;
      min-height: 0;
    }
    .ses__table-row .ses__cell--num:nth-of-type(1) {
      grid-area: num;
    }
    .ses__table-row .ses__cell--type {
      grid-area: type;
    }
    .ses__table-row .ses__cell--num:nth-of-type(3) {
      grid-area: weight;
    }
    .ses__table-row .ses__cell--num:nth-of-type(4) {
      grid-area: reps;
    }
    .ses__table-row .ses__cell--action {
      grid-area: action;
      justify-content: flex-end;
      padding-top: 0.4rem;
      border-top: 1px dashed var(--color-border);
    }
    .ses__table-row .ses__cell--rpe {
      grid-area: rpe;
      justify-content: stretch;
      padding-top: 0.4rem;
    }
    .ses__rpe-set {
      justify-content: stretch;
    }
    .ses__rpe-select {
      flex: 1 1 auto;
      width: auto;
    }
    .ses__picker-name {
      white-space: normal;
    }
    .ses__rpe {
      gap: 1.0rem;
    }
    .ses__rpe-readout {
      min-width: 0;
    }
    .ses__fatigue-btn,
    .ses__mood-btn {
      width: 4.4rem;
      height: 4.4rem;
    }
  }

  /* â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•
     REST TIMER WIDGET (added 2026-08-04)
     Sticky bar that pops up at the bottom of the page when
     the user marks a set as complete. Shows the exercise
     name + total rest time and counts down every second.
     â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â• */
  .ses__rest-timer {
    position: fixed;
    left: 50%;
    bottom: 1.6rem;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    z-index: 30;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.2rem;
    width: min(48rem, calc(100% - 3.2rem));
    padding: 1.0rem 1.2rem;
    background-color: var(--color-surface-2);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-accent);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-2),
                0 0 0 1px var(--alpha-bg-subtle);
  }

  .ses__rest-timer-icon {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 4.0rem;
    height: 4.0rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent) 18%, transparent);
    color: var(--color-accent);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .ses__rest-timer-icon svg {
    width: 1.9rem;
    height: 1.9rem;
  }

  .ses__rest-timer-body {
    flex: 1 1 auto;
    min-width: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.2rem;
  }

  .ses__rest-timer-label {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-text);
    line-height: 1.2;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .ses__rest-timer-readout {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 2.4rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    line-height: 1;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .ses__rest-timer-readout.is-done {
    color: var(--color-success);
  }

  .ses__rest-timer-skip {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    height: 4.4rem;
    padding: 0 1.2rem;
    background-color: var(--alpha-bg-soft);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    cursor: pointer;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    transition: background-color var(--transition-fast),
                border-color var(--transition-fast),
                color var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .ses__rest-timer-skip:hover {
    background-color: var(--alpha-border-faint);
    border-color: var(--alpha-border);
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .ses__rest-timer-skip:active {
    transform: scale(0.97);
  }

  .ses__rest-timer-skip svg {
    width: 1.3rem;
    height: 1.3rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .ses__rest-timer {
      width: calc(100% - 2rem);
      bottom: 1.0rem;
      gap: 0.8rem;
      padding: 0.8rem 1.0rem;
    }
    .ses__rest-timer-icon {
      width: 3.4rem;
      height: 3.4rem;
    }
    .ses__rest-timer-readout {
      font-size: 2.0rem;
    }
  }

  /* â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•
     REDUCED MOTION
     â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â• */
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .ses__btn,
    .ses__icon-btn,
    .ses__add-btn,
    .ses__input,
    .ses__select,
    .ses__search-input,
    .ses__picker-item,
    .ses__picker-tip-toggle,
    .ses__template,
    .ses__ex-superset-remove,
    .ses__ex-superset-select,
    .ses__ex-offer-btn,
    .ses__ex-offer-dismiss,
    .ses__table-row,
    .ses__rpe-input,
    .ses__rpe-value,
    .ses__fatigue-btn,
    .ses__mood-btn,
    .ses__notes-textarea,
    .ses__btn--warmup,
    .ses__ex-toggle,
    .ses__ex-chevron,
    .ses__mrv-btn,
    .ses__actions {
      transition: none;
    }
  }
  /* Narrow-phone layout: keep exercise controls readable instead of
     compressing the header into three competing inline controls. */
  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .ses__ex-header {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 4.4rem;
      align-items: start;
    }
    .ses__ex-toggle {
      grid-column: 1;
      grid-row: 1;
      width: 100%;
    }
    .ses__ex-header > .ses__ex-superset-select {
      grid-column: 1;
      grid-row: 2;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: none;
      margin-top: 0.2rem;
    }
    .ses__ex-header > .ses__icon-btn {
      grid-column: 2;
      grid-row: 1;
    }
    .ses__ex-head {
      align-items: flex-start;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }
    .ses__ex-actions {
      align-items: stretch;
      flex-direction: column;
    }
    .ses__ex-actions .ses__btn {
      width: 100%;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 360px) {
    .ses__rest-timer-skip {
      width: 4.4rem;
      padding: 0;
      justify-content: center;
